    questions:[{question:'Why did a successful host test not end the case?',options:['Host reachability and application service health are different observations.','A reachable host can never run a relay.','The game requires a fixed number of commands regardless of evidence.'],answer:0,explanation:'The management path could work while the relay service remained stopped.'},{question:'Which result supports the recovery claim most strongly?',options:['A message from an unverified portal says restored.','The repaired approved workflow runs and the separate service check shows active (running).','The script’s filename contains recover.'],answer:1,explanation:'Actual approved execution and observed service state establish the bounded lab outcome.'},{question:'What remains after successful recovery?',options:['Nothing; restored service identifies the attacker.','The preserved configuration must be deleted immediately.','Continued investigation of cause and identity, with evidence retained and conclusions limited.'],answer:2,explanation:'Restoration establishes a service outcome, not complete causal explanation or attribution.'}],
    debrief:'The emergency relay runs again. The welcome hut, Owl’s archive, Bramble’s outpost, and the ranger map receive the signal. Your preserved evidence remains available, and the cause and identity questions stay open. INCOMING TRANSMISSION — Regional Operations: “We have read your careful report. When our next training chapter opens, we would like you to join us at The Office.” Invitation earned; The Office and The Night Shift are still in development and are not playable. Completing this foundation is a starting point for further practical training, not certification or proof of job readiness.',
    ending:[{speaker:'PATCH',title:'A valley that remembers',text:'The little hut light came back first. Then Owl’s archive. Then Bramble’s outpost. I counted all of them. This time I checked the results.'},{speaker:'NOVA',title:'The next invitation',text:'Regional Operations has read your report and invited you to the next training chapter: The Office. It is still being built, and Night Shift will follow later. Today, the valley is connected again.'},{speaker:'OWL',title:'Keep the notebook',text:'You earned a beginning, not a claim to know everything. Return to the unfamiliar cases, explain your reasoning, and keep practising. We will need that notebook again.'}],
